message: "如果在研究或报告中使用了本软件，请按以下信息引用。If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "VeriScope AI（鉴真全域）: sentence-level verification and quality gate for RAG evaluation"
abstract: >-
  VeriScope AI splits RAG answers into atomic statements, checks each statement against
  the retrieved context, and applies a quality gate (positive-sample faithfulness and
  context precision, default thresholds 0.8) to decide whether a batch of answers may ship.
  Gate verdicts can be replayed offline from archived results and wired into CI as a
  regression gate. Metrics are computed with Ragas; this project adds sentence-level
  evidence, gate decisions, and human-review archives bound to frozen snapshots.
authors:
